{
  "vcon": "0.4.0",
  "uuid": "a02fbee3-ed7c-8823-ab3e-2522049e25be",
  "created_at": "2026-01-26T12:11:04-05:00",
  "subject": "Inbound call, Public Works",
  "parties": [
    {
      "name": "Neusa Semedo",
      "role": "resident",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    },
    {
      "name": "Lorraine Medeiros",
      "role": "clerk",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    }
  ],
  "dialog": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-26T12:06:58-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Public Works, this is Lorraine. How can I help you?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-26T12:07:03-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, I want to know about the snow ban. The parking ban. When does it lift?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-26T12:07:11-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, the snow parking ban. Let me make sure I help you with the right street. Where are you calling from, what's the address?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-26T12:07:22-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "466 Dean Avenue. That's in the Fifth Ward."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-26T12:07:26-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "466 Dean Avenue, got it. And you're asking about the ban from the storm that came in Sunday?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-26T12:07:35-05:00",
      "duration": 17,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes. The snow-to-rain storm. It came Sunday, it finished today. Now it's all slush and the cars are still parked out there, and I don't know if I'm allowed to move mine or put it back."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-26T12:07:52-05:00",
      "duration": 18,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Right. So the ban stays in effect until the city announces it's lifted, and that usually comes after the plows have been through the streets. Let me check where we are on that. Can you hold a moment?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-26T12:08:10-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I'll hold."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-26T12:08:12-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "[pause] Sorry, I'm putting a lid on something here. Hold on. [pause] There, it popped off. These lids."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-26T12:08:21-05:00",
      "duration": 17,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "No trouble at all, take your time. I'm back. So I'm looking at the update, and the ban is still on for now. Crews are still working the streets after the rain turned it heavy and wet."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-26T12:08:38-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "So it doesn't lift today."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-26T12:08:41-05:00",
      "duration": 19,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I can't tell you a specific hour. The announcement goes out once the main streets and the side streets are finished. Do you want me to say what I'd expect? Probably later today or tomorrow morning, but that depends on the crews."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-26T12:09:00-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Later today or tomorrow. Okay. And my street, Dean Avenue. When will it be cleared? There's a lot of heavy stuff out there."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-26T12:09:11-05:00",
      "duration": 21,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Dean Avenue, in the Fifth Ward. Side streets come after the main roads, so it's likely among the later ones. I don't have a time for your block. I can put a note in that you called about it, that it's still not cleared at 466 Dean."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-26T12:09:32-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, put that. It's not plowed. There's a pile at the end, too."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-26T12:09:39-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "A pile at the end of the street. Is that blocking the road, or is it more at the corner?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-26T12:09:49-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "The corner. You can't see around it."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-26T12:09:53-05:00",
      "duration": 12,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, I'll note the pile at the corner, limited visibility. Do you want a call back, or are you fine just watching for the announcement?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-26T12:10:05-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "You can call me. 401-555-0198."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-26T12:10:08-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Let me read that back. 401-555-0198. Is that right?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-26T12:10:13-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "That's right."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-26T12:10:15-05:00",
      "duration": 14,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Good. So, I've got 466 Dean Avenue, street not yet plowed, a snow pile at the corner, and you wanted to know when the ban lifts. I'll pass it along."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-26T12:10:29-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "And the ban, I keep my car where it is until they say."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-26T12:10:36-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, I'd leave it off the street until the ban is lifted. If you have a driveway or somewhere off the street, that's safest."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-26T12:10:47-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "It's in the driveway. Fine. Then I wait."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-26T12:10:51-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "That's right. Is there anything else I can help with today?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-26T12:10:57-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "No. That's all. Thank you."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-26T12:11:00-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "You're welcome, Ms. Semedo. Take care."
    }
  ],
